/S /P
/E (1.2 These safety codes provide guidelines for various aspects such as general safety practices, safety in construction, excavation, Material and explosives handling, electrical safety, fire safety, excavation safety, canal safety, special works, Tunneling, and Common hazards. The implementation of these standards ensures that workers are equipped with the proper training, tools, and infrastructure to safely carry out tasks and minimize risks associated with such massive projects.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
