<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (a\) As a protection against excessive damage due to occurrence of faults, transformers fitted with conservators should be protected with Bucholz relay; b\) All other transformers should be equipped with oil temperature alarms or excess current relay protection. c\) The level and dielectric strength of the transformer oil should be checked at periodic intervals and in the event of presence of a large quantity of sludge, the oil shall be reconditioned/ replaced. d\) Diagnostic devices like PD monitoring system etc. shall be provided to read the health of transformers with capacity 20 MVA and above.)
/E (a\) As a protection against excessive damage due to occurrence of faults, transformers fitted with conservators should be protected with Bucholz relay; b\) All other transformers should be equipped with oil temperature alarms or excess current relay protection. c\) The level and dielectric strength of the transformer oil should be checked at periodic intervals and in the event of presence of a large quantity of sludge, the oil shall be reconditioned/ replaced. d\) Diagnostic devices like PD monitoring system etc. shall be provided to read the health of transformers with capacity 20 MVA and above.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
>>
